docs {
  # Panduan API
  
  Endpoints untuk manajemen panduan/dokumen panduan.
  
  **Base URL:** `/api/panduan`
  
  ---
  
  ## Endpoints
  
  | Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth | Role |
  |--------|----------|-------------|------|------|
  | GET | `/` | List panduan dengan pagination | ✅ | All |
  | GET | `/:id` | Detail panduan by ID | ✅ | All |
  | POST | `/` | Upload panduan baru | ✅ | Admin |
  | PUT | `/:id` | Update panduan | ✅ | Admin |
  | DELETE | `/:id` | Hapus panduan | ✅ | Admin |
  
  ---
  
  ## Data Model
  
  ```typescript
  interface Panduan {
    id: string;          // UUID
    judul: string;       // Judul panduan
    isi_panduan: string; // Isi/konten panduan (HTML/text)
    file_url: string | null; // URL file panduan (PDF)
    createdAt: string;   // ISO timestamp
    updatedAt: string;   // ISO timestamp
  }
  ```
}
